{"id":"35dc8fe8cb585126","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-cohen.md","title":"One Cohen Forcing Adds a Real","display":"thm-cohen — One Cohen Forcing Adds a Real","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cohen","aliases":["58-thm-cohen"],"display":"thm-cohen — One Cohen Forcing Adds a Real","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cohen"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cohen</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cohen — One Cohen Forcing Adds a Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md\">../batch14/58-df-cohen.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,1)=\\operatorname{Fn}(\\omega,2,{&lt;}\\omega)\">\\(\\mathbb P\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,1)=\\operatorname{Fn}(\\omega,2,{&lt;}\\omega)\\)</span>，按反包含排序</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot G\">\\(\\dot G\\)</span>（规范泛型滤子名），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot c\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\dot G\">\\(\\dot c\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\dot G\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check{(2^\\omega)^V}\">\\(\\check{(2^\\omega)^V}\\)</span>（基模型中所有实数的规范名）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c^V=(2^{\\aleph_0})^V\">\\(\\mathfrak c^V=(2^{\\aleph_0})^V\\)</span>（基模型的连续统基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}new\\text{-}real}\\vdash \\mathbb P\\Vdash \\dot c\\in 2^\\omega\\land\\dot c\\notin\\check{(2^\\omega)^V}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}new\\text{-}real}\\vdash \\mathbb P\\Vdash \\dot c\\in 2^\\omega\\land\\dot c\\notin\\check{(2^\\omega)^V}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}continuum}\\vdash \\mathbb P\\Vdash 2^{\\aleph_0}=\\check{\\mathfrak c^V}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}continuum}\\vdash \\mathbb P\\Vdash 2^{\\aleph_0}=\\check{\\mathfrak c^V}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一式表达 Cohen 泛型实数不属于基模型。</li>\n<li>单个 Cohen 强迫是可数且 ccc；它添加新实数但不改变实数集的基数。不能把这一点表述为“旧连续统加一”。</li>\n<li>添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 个 Cohen 实数时连续统的值需要额外的基数算术假设，不能从单实数情形直接外推。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cohen.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cohen.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak c^V=(2^{\\aleph_0})^V$（基模型的连续统基数，见 [[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Add}(\\omega,1)=\\operatorname{Fn}(\\omega,2,{<}\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot G","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot c\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\dot G","display":false},{"tex":"\\check{(2^\\omega)^V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c^V=(2^{\\aleph_0})^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}new\\text{-}real}\\vdash \\mathbb P\\Vdash \\dot c\\in 2^\\omega\\land\\dot c\\notin\\check{(2^\\omega)^V}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}continuum}\\vdash \\mathbb P\\Vdash 2^{\\aleph_0}=\\check{\\mathfrak c^V}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1297,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4091","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-cohen.md|58-thm-cohen]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["aa69e82627a80f1e","99c5552e170feee3"]}